  "_about": "BMW's own cluster with a few additions on top (Chase, Nov 15 2026): no background, so BMW's gauges, map and lights all show. Shift lights under the driver camera between BMW's turn arrows (x 790-1150, y 138-166, on a dark strip that covers BMW's model badge); on cars without the camera, Apex's No camera row and bar. Four small GT3 boxes in the lower inside of BMW's two dials, under its digital speed (left) and gear (right): fuel %, coolant, oil and boost by default (readout slots 1-4). Placed off a photo of the stock cluster in SPORT+ (Nov 15 2026; photo to panel x = 960 + (px - 985) / 0.8, y = 690 + (py - 742) / 0.77), so expect a nudge once seen on the car; BMW lays its dials out differently in other modes.",
